{"id":"493350","name":"腌洋姜","author":"elmonte","authorId":"266491","desc":"","cover":"images/493350/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"洋姜","amount":"500g"}],"sub":[{"name":"生抽","amount":"2汤勺"},{"name":"米醋","amount":"2汤勺"},{"name":"白糖","amount":"40g"},{"name":"盐","amount":"1茶匙"},{"name":"水","amount":"500ml"},{"name":"八角","amount":"2粒"},{"name":"小干辣椒","amount":"2个"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"洋姜刷洗干净。","img":"images/493350/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"切薄片。","img":"images/493350/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"放入1茶匙盐拌匀，腌1个小时。","img":"images/493350/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"把腌出的水倒掉。","img":"images/493350/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"用纯净水(额外的水)冲洗一遍，挤干水份。","img":"images/493350/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"洋姜用盐腌的时间，做腌汁：砂锅放入500ml水，放入2汤勺生抽。","img":"images/493350/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"汤勺米醋。","img":"images/493350/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"克糖，2粒八角，2个干辣椒。(我家不能吃辣，喜欢辣的可以放多点辣椒。)","img":"images/493350/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"煮开后离火放凉。","img":"images/493350/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"把放凉的腌汁倒入洋姜里。(容器要用玻璃或瓷的。)","img":"images/493350/step_10.jpg"},{"step":11,"desc":"腌一个晚上就可以吃了。","img":"images/493350/step_11.jpg"},{"step":12,"desc":"非常爽脆，开胃。","img":"images/493350/step_12.jpg"}],"tips":"此方一次不建议腌多，最好2-3天吃完。 \n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：砂锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}